  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 1st March 2006, the erection of a generator is unlawful within the meaning of section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reasons:\r\nThe proposed development is within the curtilage of a Listed Building and would have a material impact upon the appearance of the site, furthermore the information and evidence provided is deemed insufficient for the local Authority to accept that a generator had been located at the site continuously since 1989. Planning permission is therefore required.\r\n"
